  "definition": "Liabilities, Fund Equity and Other Credits",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-12-09",
  "historyNote": "#5072, eff 2-21-91; amd by #6125, eff 11-23-95; ss by #6476, eff 3-26-97; amd by #6869, eff 10-20-98; ss by #8306, eff 3-22-05; ss by #10304, eff 3-22-13; ss by #13503, eff 12-9-22",
